 only ran in staging. Because v2.3.0 has a healthy production history, the change-manager approval rule did not apply.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, which left the service mixed. I retried, and the second attempt completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** The SEV2 incident creation timed out, but the incident was recorded. It is INC-0001, open, and describes the failure, the rollback, and the partial failure. I did not create a duplicate.\n\nFollow-up: someone should look into why v2.3.1 failed and why the orchestrator halted the first rollback before anyone re-releases.", "type": "text"}]}]}